    "title": "Authorities Investigate Male Death at East St. Louis Park - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dan Brannan ,\n8 hours ago EAST ST. LOUIS — Authorities are investigating the death of a male found in Frank Holten State Park in East Saint Louis, officials said Wednesday, Oct. 22, 2025. The Illinois State Police Division of Criminal Investigation Zone 6 Public Safety Enforcement Group responded to the scene at approximately 10:21 a.m. Wednesday, after being requested by the Cahokia Heights Police Department to conduct a death investigation. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
